<title>SPAIN: Spanish Treasury fixes new 5-yr coupon at 7.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Spanish Treasury fixes new 5-yr coupon at 7.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish Treasury announced on Friday that it had set a new 7.90 percent coupon for its five-year bond, which will be issued on October 15 with a maturity date on February 28, 2002.</p>
<p>The previous five-year bond coupon was 8.40 percent.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
